# Kconfig current selection — generated by `make menuconfig` / `make defconfig-*`.
# Tracked per-deployment via config/defconfigs/*.config (committed); not here.
.config
.config.old
# iCloud / Finder duplicates (".config 2", ".config 3.old", etc.) — same role.
.config[ .]*
# The same conflict copies of the artifact directories. iCloud produced
# `build 2/` and `target 2/` at the root (found empty 2026-09-21, review item
# B1-03). Empty is the lucky case: a half-synced `build 2/image_hashes.rs` or
# ELF is exactly the stale-fixture failure this tree has already paid for once.
/build [0-9]*
/target [0-9]*

# Build artifacts
/target/
/build/
# The same paths as SYMLINKS rather than directories. A pattern ending in `/`
# matches directories only, so once the build artifacts moved out of iCloud
# (2026-08-29) the symlinks left in their place showed up as untracked. This
# tree lives inside iCloud Drive, and `build/` and `target/` must NOT sync.
/target
/build
# Per-crate target dirs (workspace-excluded host-test crates, demos, and
# userspace each build into their own target/). Catch-all so a new crate
# can't accidentally commit build artifacts again.
**/target/
# Userspace images built for an aarch64 16/64 KiB granule
# (`make AARCH64_PAGE_SIZE=16384|65536`) use a target dir per granule.
**/target-16k/
**/target-64k/
# The same, for the per-crate symlinks (41 of them).
**/target

# RFC-0027 WCET: crates/drivers/sys/build.rs generates wcet_points_generated.rs
# into OUT_DIR, and crates/drivers/sys/src/wcet.rs includes it from there. A
# checkout built before 2026-09-14 can still hold a copy in src/; nothing
# includes it, and this entry keeps it out of a commit. The committed index
# is crates/drivers/sys/wcet_points.json.
crates/drivers/sys/src/wcet_points_generated.rs

# Disk images
*.img

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Agent / AI editor instructions
AGENTS.md

# Other agentic-IDE workspace metadata
.antigravitycli/

tools/keys/

# mdBook HTML output
book/book/

# TLC model-checker artifacts
formal/tla/*_TTrace_*.tla
formal/tla/*_TTrace_*.bin
formal/tla/states/
tools/tla2tools.jar
rfcs/
# Project documents are kept locally, not published (only README.md is).
docs/
